    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Backend context construction. Null fields inherit ModelVariant then server config, except <computeroutput>n_outputs_max</computeroutput> which CreateContext defaults to 1. Structural at the field: these are baked into llama_context_params at context creation, so a change means a new context and a lost KV cache. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
